{"id":"msg_m_ex_acpu_03","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_acpu","label":"A.C.P.U. · Group"},"label":"3. Hey, guys!","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_acpu_02","next":"msg_m_ex_acpu_04","speakers":{"quiry":"Quiry","poli":"Poli","miranda":"Miranda"},"icons":{"quiry":"si_c033_00_s","poli":"si_c030_00_s","miranda":"si_c032_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_1","text":"Hey, guys!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_2","text":"We agreed to meet at the park today, right?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_3","text":"We were supposed to meet up a while ago, so when are you guys coming?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_4","text":"Huh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_5","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_5","text":"???","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_6","text":"???","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_7","text":"Huh? What's with everyone's reactions?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_8","text":"We have plans for today?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_9","text":"Yes, we do!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_10","text":"Have you forgotten about them already?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_11","text":"Sigh...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_12","text":"I had no idea!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_13","text":"But I'll be there in a jiffy!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_14","text":"Hold on a sec, Miranda.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_15","text":"We still have loads of time to spare before our meetup!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_16","text":"Ah, really?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_17","text":"Then why is Quiry already there?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_18","text":"She must have misread the clock again.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_19","text":"Think about it. Who would hang out at a time like this? It's far too early.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_20","text":"???","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_21","text":"Oh, darn it!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_22","text":"You're right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_23","text":"How did I get the time wrong again? :/","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_24","text":"That's why I keep telling you to check your phone or tablet for the time,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_25","text":"especially when you find that the dormitory clock is difficult to read.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_26","text":"I didn't hear the alarm go off, so I thought I overslept.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_27","text":"That's why I glanced hastily at the clock before bolting out the door.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_28","text":"Wait a sec.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_29","text":"Does this mean","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_30","text":"I just woke you all up?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_31","text":"I'm all right since I'm an early riser,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_32","text":"but I can't say the same for Miranda and Commander.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_33","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_33","text":"The loud beeping from Bla woke me up.","jump":"m_ex_acpu_03_35"},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_34","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_34","text":"I was up early as well.","jump":"m_ex_acpu_03_40"},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_35","text":"Oh dear,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_36","text":"I'm really sorry about that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_37","text":"You must be so exhausted right now.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_38","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_38","text":"It's okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_39","text":":'(","jump":"m_ex_acpu_03_43"},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_40","text":"Really?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_41","text":"Phew, that's a relief!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_42","text":"But I apologize for disturbing you >~<","jump":"m_ex_acpu_03_43"},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_43","text":"What about you, Miranda?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_44","text":"Did I wake you up?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_45","text":"I'm not quite sure.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_46","text":"I've been talking to you since I opened my eyes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_47","text":"I guess it's safe to say that I've woken you up.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_48","text":"I'm really sorry!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_acpu_03_49","text":"Dinner's on me tonight.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_acpu_03_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli"